{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEAR OF SLEEP\u00a0\u00a0is a sci fi horror game with an old-school aesthetic that refuses to hold your hand. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the MetroBunker \u2014 a sprawling subterranean shelter built in the shadow of war. As Roy, an R0-1 maintenance android, traverse industrial corridors, collapsing infrastructure, and cryptic interludes while grotesque creatures stalk the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a looming breach, your directive is simple: return to your maker before it\u2019s too late. Each step deeper reveals sabotage, decay, and a spreading sickness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. Carve your own path through terror, mystery, and survival. Wishlist now.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008240?t=1758125592","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008240/9448ebd9b8b2bcec4f2fe58bc1252bce893e5a48/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758125592","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008240/760ec2d9b830ba9d9b49160649c0d80f6a0a8896/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758125592","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008240/760ec2d9b830ba9d9b49160649c0d80f6a0a8896/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758125592","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Fear of Sleep contains psychological horror and violence throughout, presented in an old school ps1/2 era aesthetic."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEAR OF SLEEP\u00a0\u00a0is a sci fi horror game with an old-school aesthetic that refuses to hold your hand. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the MetroBunker \u2014 a sprawling subterranean shelter built in the shadow of war. As Roy, an R0-1 maintenance android, traverse industrial corridors, collapsing infrastructure, and cryptic interludes while grotesque creatures stalk the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a looming breach, your directive is simple: return to your maker before it\u2019s too late. Each step deeper reveals sabotage, decay, and a spreading sickness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. Carve your own path through terror, mystery, and survival. Wishlist now.</p>","developers":["Signal Decay Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008240/f368e8aa0dace6539a55979050c10985294fa09e/header.jpg?t=1758125592","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Fear of Sleep","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Konrad Honey"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nTemas sens\u00edveis\nMedo","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008240/cd048a76aed9a3fc4554fb3d1f646704bc1c65cd/ss_cd048a76aed9a3fc4554fb3d1f646704bc1c65cd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758125592","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008240/cd048a76aed9a3fc4554fb3d1f646704bc1c65cd/ss_cd048a76aed9a3fc4554fb3d1f646704bc1c65cd.600x338.jpg?t=1758125592"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/400824